ui-text.md) — screenshots only, 14/23; [Unbuilt proposals](sweep-unbuilt-proposals-stay-visible.md) — say what stays.\n- Wording: [Code's own terms](use-the-codes-own-terms.md) — \"syndicate\", never \"pool\"; [No \"arrive\"](no-arrive-jargon-for-files.md) — opened/imported/loaded/added; [AI is the name](ai-is-the-feature-name.md) — not \"the Agent\"; [\"Specializes in 3D printing\"](ai-specializes-in-3d-printing-claim.md) — never \"trained\" until a trained model is live; unbuilt.\n- Prepare and project UI: [Setup card headline](setup-card-headline-setup-record.md) — setup_record; [Setup card shape](setup-card-two-part-shape.md) — words above, facts below; [Setup-changed entry](setup-changed-entry-point.md) — A+C+D; [All settings](all-settings-panel.md) — settings_catalog; [Filament chip](filament-chip-no-spool-decisions.md) — no saved spools; [Chip statement](chip-states-selection-not-machine.md) — selection, not the machine; [File-printer switch](file-printer-switch-decisions.md) — Option 2; [Print issues](persistent-print-issues-spike.md) — Ask AI / Resolve; [Check print design](check-print-design-decisions.md) — slice_report panel; [Check print built](check-print-implementation.md); [Auto slicing reverted](auto-slice-reverted.md) — locked the UI; [Classic view return](classic-view-return-decisions.md) — banner + View menu; [Calibration](calibration-design-decisions.md) — own project.\n- Saving and menus: [Autosave design](autosave-design-research.md) — two modified trackers; [Autosave cost](autosave-save-cost-results.md) — ~2.3 µs/triangle; [Store format compat](project-store-format-compat-review.md) — StoredFormat rule, 2.0.0 fixture, Home hides unreadable, Get the new version… button; [App menus](app-menu-decisions.md) — same everywhere, grey not hide; [Save As → Export 3MF](save-as-becomes-export-3mf.md) — Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+S; [Settings menu](settings-menu-window-plus-ask-ai.md) — window + Ask AI.\n- Print history: [Screen](print-history-screen-design.md) — one